{"html":"\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head>\n      <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n      <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n      <title>Reset Your Password - Test</title>\n      <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f8f9fa; }\n        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc3545 0%, #c82333 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }\n        .content { padding: 30px; }\n        .button { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc3545 0%, #c82333 100%); color: white; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; font-weight: bold; }\n        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }\n        .warning { background-color: #f8d7da; border-left: 4px solid #dc3545; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; }\n      </style>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n          <h1>🔒 Password Reset Request</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n          <h2>Hello Test!</h2>\n          \n          \n          <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n            <a href=\"http://localhost:3000/auth/reset-password?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJkMjdiZjU4ZS1jYmMwLTRkZmYtYWM1Ny0xMDE3NjAwNTk2ZTciLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3RAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJ0eXBlIjoicGFzc3dvcmRfcmVzZXQiLCJpYXQiOjE3NTY5NzkxMDAsImV4cCI6MTc1Njk4MjcwMH0.KvEaa80InoEg8KdxXESohMqFt6D8_gFOShOmZKsVLF4\" class=\"button\">Reset My Password</a>\n          </div>\n          \n          <p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>\n          <p style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; word-break: break-all; font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px;\">\n            http://localhost:3000/auth/reset-password?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJkMjdiZjU4ZS1jYmMwLTRkZmYtYWM1Ny0xMDE3NjAwNTk2ZTciLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3RAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJ0eXBlIjoicGFzc3dvcmRfcmVzZXQiLCJpYXQiOjE3NTY5NzkxMDAsImV4cCI6MTc1Njk4MjcwMH0.KvEaa80InoEg8KdxXESohMqFt6D8_gFOShOmZKsVLF4\n          </p>\n          \n          <div class=\"warning\">\n            <strong>⚠️ Security Note:</strong> This password reset link will expire in 1 hours. If you didn't request this password reset, please ignore this email and your password will remain unchanged.\n          </div>\n          \n          <p>For your security:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>This link can only be used once</li>\n            <li>We recommend using a strong, unique password</li>\n            <li>Never share your password with anyone</li>\n          </ul>\n          \n          <p>If you continue to have problems, contact our support team.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n          <p>Need help? Contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@balletmanagement.com\">support@balletmanagement.com</a></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n    ","level":"info","message":"📧 EMAIL SENT (Console)","subject":"Reset Your Password - Test","text":"\n\nHello Test,\n\nWe received a request to reset the password for your  account.\n\nReset your password by clicking this link:\nhttp://localhost:3000/auth/reset-password?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJkMjdiZjU4ZS1jYmMwLTRkZmYtYWM1Ny0xMDE3NjAwNTk2ZTciLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3RAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJ0eXBlIjoicGFzc3dvcmRfcmVzZXQiLCJpYXQiOjE3NTY5NzkxMDAsImV4cCI6MTc1Njk4MjcwMH0.KvEaa80InoEg8KdxXESohMqFt6D8_gFOShOmZKsVLF4\n\nThis link will expire in 1 hours. If you didn't request this password reset, please ignore this email.\n\nBest regards,\nThe Team\n    ","timestamp":"2025-09-04T09:45:00.647Z","to":"test@example.com"}
