{"html":"\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head>\n      <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n      <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n      <title>Activate Your Ballet Studio Management Account</title>\n      <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f8f9fa; }\n        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }\n        .content { padding: 30px; }\n        .button { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; font-weight: bold; }\n        .button:hover { opacity: 0.9; }\n        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }\n        .warning { background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; }\n      </style>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n          <h1>🩰 Welcome to Ballet Studio Management</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n          <h2>Hello qwe!</h2>\n          \n          <p>Welcome to <strong>Ballet Studio Management</strong>! To get started, please activate your account by clicking the button below.</p>\n          \n          <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n            <a href=\"http://localhost:3000/auth/activate?token=f19d1ac2e396c5279bcede9869af7138c24d7cb4298598b4d9624f764fc25ce5\" class=\"button\">Activate My Account</a>\n          </div>\n          \n          <p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>\n          <p style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; word-break: break-all; font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px;\">\n            http://localhost:3000/auth/activate?token=f19d1ac2e396c5279bcede9869af7138c24d7cb4298598b4d9624f764fc25ce5\n          </p>\n          \n          <div class=\"warning\">\n            <strong>⚠️ Security Note:</strong> This activation link will expire in 24 hours. If you didn't request this account, please ignore this email.\n          </div>\n          \n          <p>After activating your account, managers will be able to assign you to establishments and roles.</p>\n          \n          <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>\n          \n          <p>Best regards,<br>The Ballet Studio Management Team</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n          <p>© 2024 Ballet Studio Management. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <p>Need help? Contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@balletmanagement.com\">support@balletmanagement.com</a></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n    ","level":"info","message":"📧 EMAIL SENT (Console)","subject":"Activate Your Ballet Studio Management Account","text":"\nWelcome to Ballet Studio Management!\n\nHello qwe,\n\nWelcome to Ballet Studio Management! To get started, please activate your account.\n\nActivate your account by clicking this link:\nhttp://localhost:3000/auth/activate?token=f19d1ac2e396c5279bcede9869af7138c24d7cb4298598b4d9624f764fc25ce5\n\nThis link will expire in 24 hours. If you didn't request this account, please ignore this email.\n\nBest regards,\nThe Ballet Studio Management Team\n    ","timestamp":"2025-09-04T11:00:47.240Z","to":"zxc@zsx.com"}
