{"html":"\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head>\n      <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n      <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n      <title>Welcome to Ballet Studio Management! Your Account is Ready</title>\n      <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f8f9fa; }\n        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745 0%, #20c997 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }\n        .content { padding: 30px; }\n        .button { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745 0%, #20c997 100%); color: white; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; font-weight: bold; }\n        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }\n      </style>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n          <h1>🎉 Welcome to Ballet Studio Management!</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n          <h2>Hello qweqwe!</h2>\n          \n          <p>Congratulations! Your account has been successfully activated and you're now part of the Ballet Studio Management community.</p>\n          \n          <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n            <a href=\"http://localhost:3000/login\" class=\"button\">Start Using Your Account</a>\n          </div>\n          \n          <p>Here's what you can do now:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>📅 View and book your classes</li>\n            <li>📊 Track your progress and attendance</li>\n            <li>💬 Connect with instructors and fellow students</li>\n            <li>⚙️ Manage your profile and preferences</li>\n            <li>💳 Handle payments and packages</li>\n          </ul>\n          \n          <p>We're excited to have you on board and look forward to supporting you on your fitness journey!</p>\n          \n          <p>Best regards,<br>The Ballet Studio Management Team</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n          <p>© 2024 Ballet Studio Management. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <p>Need help? Contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@balletmanagement.com\">support@balletmanagement.com</a></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </body>\n    </html>\n    ","level":"info","message":"📧 EMAIL SENT (Console)","subject":"Welcome to Ballet Studio Management! Your Account is Ready","text":"\nWelcome to Ballet Studio Management!\n\nHello qweqwe,\n\nCongratulations! Your account has been successfully activated and you're now part of the Ballet Studio Management community.\n\nYou can now log in and start using your account: http://localhost:3000/login\n\nHere's what you can do:\n- View and book your classes\n- Track your progress and attendance\n- Connect with instructors and fellow students\n- Manage your profile and preferences\n- Handle payments and packages\n\nWe're excited to have you on board!\n\nBest regards,\nThe Ballet Studio Management Team\n    ","timestamp":"2025-09-05T19:39:33.232Z","to":"qwe@qweqweqwe.com"}
